Coach's wife: Honey, I don't know, but he is waiting for you in the kitchen.

279
00:17:40,900 --> 00:17:47,300
教练:你保证?他向我道歉后我们就回去.
Coach: Promise?If I let him apologize, we can go.

280
00:17:47,300 --> 00:17:48,660
麦琪:洛维特教练想在厨房和你谈谈,
Maggie: Coach Lovett wants to have a word with you in the kitchen,

281
00:17:48,720 --> 00:17:50,020
他想单独谢谢你.
and he wants to thank you man to man.

282
00:17:50,500 --> 00:17:53,700
教练:什么事?
Coach: So!

283
00:17:53,700 --> 00:17:55,300
迈克:什么事?
Mike: So!

284
00:17:55,300 --> 00:17:59,900
教练:迈克,一个真正的男人就该好好认错.
Coach: Mike, it takes a real man to admit his mistakes.

285
00:17:59,900 --> 00:18:02,520
迈克:你什么也不用讲了,很高心你能来,我们一起去吃……
Mike: You don't need to say any more, I am just glad you are here

286
00:18:02,920 --> 00:18:03,860
Come on let's eat

287
00:18:06,100 --> 00:18:09,300
教练:等等!我想我们在这里是为了道歉的.
Coach: Hold on, hold on, I believe we are here for an apology.

288
00:18:09,300 --> 00:18:15,700
迈克:好吧,要是你想的话.
Mike: Ok, if that what you want.

289
00:18:15,700 --> 00:18:17,400
教练:那就随便说一下什么"对不起"之类的话!
Coach: About two words like I'm sorry!

290
00:18:17,400 --> 00:18:21,500
迈克:好的!你马上要说吗?
Mike: Great!You are going to say them soon?

291
00:18:21,500 --> 00:18:24,100
教练:你想让我对你说对不起?
Coach: You expect me to say I'm sorry.

292
00:18:24,100 --> 00:18:26,600
迈克:不,只要说谢谢就行.
Mike: No, just say thank you.

293
00:18:26,600 --> 00:18:28,700
教练:我为什么要说谢谢你?
Coach: Why do I thank you?

294
00:18:28,700 --> 00:18:31,400
迈克:我就是为了你才被逮捕的!
Mike: Well I did get arrested for you!

295
00:18:31,400 --> 00:18:32,500
教练:你让你这么做的?
Coach: Who asked you to?

296
00:18:32,500 --> 00:18:33,400
迈克:没人.
Mike: Nobody.

297
00:18:33,400 --> 00:18:34,180
教练:现在我已经失业了,
Coach: And now that I am out of work,

298
00:18:34,200 --> 00:18:36,140
你还想继续帮我喂饱这些孩子吗?
are you going to help me keep those mouths filled?

299
00:18:37,080 --> 00:18:39,920
你能帮我向康士坦斯解释一下她不能买胸罩的原因吗?
And are you goin to explain to my Constance why she cannot have her braces?

300
00:18:40,520 --> 00:18:43,260
还有你能帮我将另外的65份简历发出去吗?
And are you going to help me send out another 65 resumes?

301
00:18:44,100 --> 00:18:46,900
迈克:教练,我也不想你被解雇啊.
Mike: Look, coach, I didn't mean if you did get fired.

302
00:18:46,900 --> 00:18:50,480
教练:我可不愿到最后自己和七个半孩子要一起挨饿,以前我觉得教师是永远不会失业的,
Coach: And I didn't mean to end up with 7 and two thirds kids and no income,

303
00:18:51,460 --> 00:18:57,680
但我想错了.
nada, zip.I always figured that a teacher could always get a job.Not any more.

304
00:19:00,440 --> 00:19:03,320
65个学校里只有一个学校要我,
There are 65 schools, one offered me a job.

305
00:19:04,280 --> 00:19:11,680
而且钱也很少,学校又是在加州,
But I earn less money, in California.I'd have to buy a toupee.No thanks.

306
00:19:12,820 --> 00:19:16,460
我还得买假发套.我不能去那里教书,
I would rather call my brother-in-law and go to work with him pushing

307
00:19:16,460 --> 00:19:17,440
我宁肯去找我那个小舅子帮他卖痔疮药.
suppositories.

308
00:19:21,100 --> 00:19:22,700
迈克:教练,我只是想报答你.
Mike: Coach, I only want to pay you back.

309
00:19:22,700 --> 00:19:27,300
教练:报答我什么?我不知道,不过你已经为我做了很多.
Coach: Pay me back for what?I don't know, you've done a lot for me.

310
00:19:29,040 --> 00:19:31,720
教练:你说我为你做了很多,
Coach: When you say I have done a lot for you,

311
00:19:32,120 --> 00:19:34,260
是不是意味着你更加了解我?
does that mean anything like your better off having known me?

312
00:19:34,700 --> 00:19:36,500
迈克:我无法用具体的话语形容.
Mike: I mean I wouldn't use the exact words.

313
00:19:36,500 --> 00:19:39,200
教练:不过你是不是想说……
Coach: Well but ......something like that?

314
00:19:39,200 --> 00:19:58,800
迈克:是的,我想你确实令我更加了解你.
Mike: Yeah, I guess you could say that I am better off having known you.

315
00:19:58,800 --> 00:20:02,900
杰森:麦琪,我能一起帮你准备晚餐吗?
Jason: Maggie is there something I can do to help get this dinner going?

316
00:20:02,900 --> 00:20:05,700
麦琪:杰森,还有重要的事要在晚餐上讲.
Maggie: Jason, there are more important things going on then dinner.

317
00:20:05,700 --> 00:20:07,400
杰森:有四个小孩都快要饿晕了.
Jason: Four children just fainted over here.

318
00:20:07,400 --> 00:20:10,200
麦琪:哦,看谁在那!
Maggie: Oh, look who is here!

319
00:20:10,200 --> 00:20:12,100
本:开饭了!
Ben: Dinner!

320
00:20:12,100 --> 00:20:13,600
麦琪:哦,再过一会就开饭.
Maggie: Oh, it will just talk a a second to get the dinner.

321
00:20:14,840 --> 00:20:17,560
教练:等等!各位在开始吃以前,
Coach: Hold on, hold on, everybody before we start to eat tonight,

322
00:20:18,100 --> 00:20:20,240
先听我讲几句心里话.我想要为我以前的胡话向你们道歉,
I just like to say a few words from the heart.

323
00:20:21,460 --> 00:20:24,780
我就不拐弯抹角了.
I just want to apologize for all the sewage I have been pumping lately.

324
00:20:26,300 --> 00:20:30,720
就直接一点吧!我现在心里满是……
I mean why beat around the bush.Let's face it.I have been full of ...

325
00:20:31,400 --> 00:20:34,000
教练的妻子:你讲得真好!
Coach's wife: That was a very nice speech.

326
00:20:34,000 --> 00:20:34,440
教练:还没有讲完呢!我要讲的要点是,
Coach: I've not done.

327
00:20:35,420 --> 00:20:39,320
我本来已经绝望了,
You see the point I make that is I was ready to give up.

328
00:20:39,900 --> 00:20:42,180
本来以为我一辈子一事无成了,
I couldn't see how anything I have done mattered,

329
00:20:42,760 --> 00:20:48,260
以为教书也毫无意义,可是过去我不是这样的
and I couldn't see how teaching mattered, and you know it wasn't like that?

330
00:20:48,600 --> 00:20:50,800
孩子们:在我还是小孩的时候……
Kids: When I was growing up...

331
00:20:50,900 --> 00:20:53,620
教练:并非这样的.那时人们都很尊敬老师,
Coach: It wasn't.People respected the teachers,

332
00:20:54,240 --> 00:20:56,580
社会的不良现象也很少.在家也会很有安全感,
and there wasn't all the damn graffiti all over the place.

333
00:20:56,660 --> 00:20:58,540
人人都会自力更生,
And you could feel safe in your own home.

334
00:20:59,100 --> 00:21:02,400
即便是不太爱劳动的人也是一样.对不起,
And family stood up for their own even if they were not particularly find

335
00:21:02,740 --> 00:21:05,860
伊丽莎白,我并非有意讲到你的弟弟.
of them, and I am not talking about your brother, Elizabeth.

336
00:21:07,700 --> 00:21:10,500
教练的妻子:我以为你已经答应我不再说他的.
Coach's wife: I think you promise us a point.

337
00:21:11,540 --> 00:21:14,000
教练:是的,
Coach: Yeah, here it is.

338
00:21:14,600 --> 00:21:19,460
我还要说这世界上还是有很多好人,
The point is there are still a lot of people in this world that care.

339
00:21:20,460 --> 00:21:23,140
这两张桌上的人就是最好的例子.开萝尔,
And these two tables are full of them.

340
00:21:24,440 --> 00:21:27,700
谢谢策划了静坐示威的事,
Carol, thanks for help organize the sitting in.

341
00:21:29,360 --> 00:21:31,500
为了我你的确做了很大的牺牲.
you've really put you behind on the line for me.

342
00:21:32,200 --> 00:21:36,000
开萝尔:哦,那没什么.迈克,你给我闭嘴.
Carol: Ah that was nothing.Shut up Mike

343
00:21:36,000 --> 00:21:40,100
教练:另外,西沃太太,谢谢你和伊丽莎白一起准备这次晚餐.
Coach: And Mrs.Seaver.Thank you for working out this dinner with Elizabeth.

344
00:21:40,100 --> 00:21:44,100
麦琪:那没关系,不过是加八个位置而已.
Maggie: It was no problem.I only set 8 other places.

345
00:21:44,100 --> 00:21:45,600
本:难道是你摆的桌子.
Ben: You set the table?

346
00:21:46,840 --> 00:21:52,180
教练:还有西沃医生,谢谢你要求迈克静坐以坚持他的信念.
Coach: And doctor Seaver, thanks for teaching Mike to sit down for what he believes

347
00:21:52,180 --> 00:21:52,680
in

348
00:21:53,100 --> 00:21:54,900
杰森:我会为他感到骄傲的.
Jason: Pleasure was all mine.

349
00:21:57,400 --> 00:22:00,120
教练:迈克,
Coach: And Mike thanks for reminding me,

350
00:22:00,680 --> 00:22:05,080
是你让我明白作为一名教师的意义,使我没有放弃这份职业,
why I became a teacher and why I can't give it up.

351
00:22:06,340 --> 00:22:07,840
我该怎么谢谢你呢?
How can I ever thank you?

352
00:22:08,600 --> 00:22:13,200
迈克:好了,那你能不能嫁一对女儿给我?
Mike: Well, could you spare a couple of your daughters?

353
00:22:13,200 --> 00:22:14,400
教练:不可能.
Coach: Not a chance.

354
00:22:14,400 --> 00:22:17,900
迈克:那你就当我没讲过吧!
Mike: I never would have forgave myself if I didn't ask .

355
00:22:17,900 --> 00:22:23,800
教练:最后我要谢谢伊丽莎白,
Coach: And one last thing I'd like to thank my Elizabeth for being a major

356
00:22:23,800 --> 00:22:24,500
感谢你这样甘心和我一起吃苦.
pain in the butt.

357
00:22:25,600 --> 00:22:32,600
教练的妻子:哦,格拉汉姆,我会一直在你的身边的.
Coach's wife: Oh, Graham, any time.

358
00:22:32,600 --> 00:22:41,900
教练:孩子们,我太爱你们了.
Coach: And kids you know how I feel about you.

359
00:22:41,900 --> 00:22:45,700
男孩:我们也爱你,你这个大脑袋的男人.
Boy: Well we love you too, you big dump chuckle head.

360
00:22:45,700 --> 00:22:48,700
孩子们:哦,爸爸!无论发生什么,我们都会支持你的.
Kids: Oh dad!Whatever happens we will be behind you all the way .

361
00:22:48,700 --> 00:22:58,500
教练:谢谢!我想你们在加利福尼亚会过得很好的,快吃吧!
孩子们:加利福尼亚?不……
00:22:58,500
Coach: Thanks, thanks, I know we'll do just fine in California.Let's eat. Kids: California?No.....
